@ref s 35(6) (src:2016-2019)
GIVEN `the date on which the contract was made` IS A DATE
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 35(6) section 35 applies to or affects the contract` MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF NOT (`the date on which the contract was made` AT LEAST (Date 1 3 2009)) THEN JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "Nothing in this section shall apply to or affect any contract that was made before 1 March 2009"
        OTHERWISE NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "any contract that was made before 1 March 2009"

-- src:2016 | (6) Nothing in this section shall apply to or affect any contract that
-- src:2017 | was made before 1 March 2009, and the law in force immediately
-- src:2018 | before that day shall continue to apply in relation to such a contract as
-- src:2019 | if this section had not been enacted.
@ref s 35(6) the earlier law (src:2016-2019)
GIVEN `the date on which the contract was made` IS A DATE
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 35(6) the law in force immediately before 1 March 2009 continues to apply to the contract` MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF NOT (`the date on which the contract was made` AT LEAST (Date 1 3 2009)) THEN JUST TRUE
        OTHERWISE NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "in relation to such a contract as if this section had not been enacted"

-- src:2023 | (7) Nothing in this section shall limit or affect the rule of law
-- src:2024 | whereby a minor is not liable in tort for procuring a contract by means
-- src:2025 | of fraudulent representations as to his own age or any other matter.
@ref s 35(7) (src:2023-2025)
GIVEN `the rule is the rule of law whereby a minor is not liable in tort for procuring a contract by means of fraudulent representations as to his own age or any other matter` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 35(7) section 35 limits or affects the rule of law` MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF `the rule is the rule of law whereby a minor is not liable in tort for procuring a contract by means of fraudulent representations as to his own age or any other matter` THEN JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "Nothing in this section shall limit or affect the rule of law whereby a minor is not liable in tort for procuring a contract by means of fraudulent representations as to his own age or any other matter"
        OTHERWISE NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "the rule of law whereby a minor is not liable in tort for procuring a contract by means of fraudulent representations"

§ `Section 36 and the Schedule -- legal proceedings and actions by minors who have attained 18`

-- src:2035 | 36.—(1) Notwithstanding any other written law, a minor who has
-- src:2036 | attained the age of 18 years and who is not otherwise under any legal
-- src:2037 | disability —
-- src:2039 | (a) may, in his own name and without a litigation
-- src:2040 | representative, bring, defend, conduct or intervene in any
-- src:2041 | legal proceeding or action specified in the Schedule as if he
-- src:2042 | were of full age; and
@ref s 36(1)(a) (src:2035-2042)
GIVEN `the minor has attained the age of 18 years` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the minor is not otherwise under any legal disability` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the proceeding or action is specified in the Schedule` IS A MAYBE BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 36(1)(a) the minor may in his own name and without a litigation representative bring defend conduct or intervene in the proceeding or action as if he were of full age` MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF NOT (`the minor has attained the age of 18 years` AND `the minor is not otherwise under any legal disability`) THEN NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "a minor who has attained the age of 18 years and who is not otherwise under any legal disability"
        OTHERWISE
            CONSIDER `the proceeding or action is specified in the Schedule`
            WHEN JUST x THEN
                IF x THEN JUST TRUE
                ELSE NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "any legal proceeding or action specified in the Schedule" -- a scope; no "only" (rule (c) of the ruling of 2026-11-05)
            WHEN NOTHING THEN NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (undefined term): whether the proceeding is specified in the Schedule is not known

-- src:2035 | 36.—(1) Notwithstanding any other written law, a minor who has
-- src:2036 | attained the age of 18 years and who is not otherwise under any legal
-- src:2037 | disability —
-- src:2044 | (b) shall not be considered to be a person under disability on
-- src:2045 | account of his age for the purpose of any such legal
-- src:2046 | proceeding or action or for the purpose of any written law
-- src:2047 | regulating the limitation of actions.
@ref s 36(1)(b) (src:2035-2047)
GIVEN `the minor has attained the age of 18 years` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the minor is not otherwise under any legal disability` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the proceeding or action is specified in the Schedule` IS A MAYBE BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 36(1)(b) the minor is considered to be a person under disability on account of his age` MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF NOT (`the minor has attained the age of 18 years` AND `the minor is not otherwise under any legal disability`) THEN NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "a minor who has attained the age of 18 years and who is not otherwise under any legal disability"
        OTHERWISE
            CONSIDER `the proceeding or action is specified in the Schedule`
            WHEN JUST x THEN
                IF x THEN JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "shall not be considered to be a person under disability on account of his age for the purpose of any such legal proceeding or action or for the purpose of any written law regulating the limitation of actions"
                ELSE NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "any such legal proceeding or action"
            WHEN NOTHING THEN NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (undefined term): whether the proceeding is specified in the Schedule is not known

-- src:2051 | (2) The Minister may, at any time, by order published in the
-- src:2052 | Gazette, amend the Schedule.
@ref s 36(2) (src:2051-2052)
GIVEN `the order is published in the Gazette` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 36(2) the Minister has amended the Schedule` MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF `the order is published in the Gazette` THEN JUST TRUE
        OTHERWISE NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "The Minister may, at any time, by order published in the Gazette, amend the Schedule" -- the power is the Minister's; no order is among the sources

-- src:2229 | 1. Any legal proceeding or action arising from or in connection with a contract
-- src:2230 | to which the minor is a party and which, by virtue of section 35, has effect as if the
-- src:2231 | minor were of full age.
@ref Schedule para 1 (src:2229-2231)
GIVEN `the contract has effect under section 35 as if the minor were of full age` IS A MAYBE BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`The Schedule para 1 the proceeding or action arises from a contract to which the minor is a party and which has effect under section 35` MEANS
    CONSIDER `the contract has effect under section 35 as if the minor were of full age`
    WHEN JUST x THEN
        IF x THEN JUST TRUE
        ELSE NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "a contract to which the minor is a party and which, by virtue of section 35, has effect as if the minor were of full age"
    WHEN NOTHING THEN NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (undefined term): whether section 35 gives the contract that effect is not known

-- src:2238 | 2. Any legal proceeding or action arising from or in connection with the minor
-- src:2239 | acting as —
-- src:2241 | (a) a director of a company; or
-- src:2243 | (b) a manager of a limited liability partnership.
@ref Schedule para 2 (src:2238-2243)
GIVEN `the kind of proceeding or action` IS A `Kind of legal proceeding or action`
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`The Schedule para 2 the proceeding or action arises from the minor acting as a director of a company or a manager of a limited liability partnership` MEANS
    CONSIDER `the kind of proceeding or action`
    WHEN `Proceeding arising from the minor acting as a director of a company` THEN JUST TRUE
    WHEN `Proceeding arising from the minor acting as a manager of a limited liability partnership` THEN JUST TRUE
    OTHERWISE NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "Any legal proceeding or action arising from or in connection with the minor acting as — (a) a director of a company; or (b) a manager of a limited liability partnership"

-- src:2245 | 3. Any legal proceeding or action arising from or in connection with a bill of
-- src:2246 | exchange that has been drawn or indorsed —
-- src:2248 | (a) by the minor; or
-- src:2250 | (b) by another person in favour of the minor.
@ref Schedule para 3 (src:2245-2250)
GIVEN `the kind of proceeding or action` IS A `Kind of legal proceeding or action`
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`The Schedule para 3 the proceeding or action arises from a bill of exchange drawn or indorsed by the minor or by another person in favour of the minor` MEANS
    CONSIDER `the kind of proceeding or action`
    WHEN `Proceeding arising from a bill of exchange drawn or indorsed by the minor` THEN JUST TRUE
    WHEN `Proceeding arising from a bill of exchange drawn or indorsed by another person in favour of the minor` THEN JUST TRUE
    OTHERWISE NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "Any legal proceeding or action arising from or in connection with a bill of exchange that has been drawn or indorsed — (a) by the minor; or (b) by another person in favour of the minor"

-- src:2252 | 4. Where the minor is registered under the Business Names Registration
-- src:2253 | Act 2014 to carry on any business (whether as a sole proprietor or in partnership
-- src:2254 | with one or more other persons) —
-- src:2256 | (a) any legal proceeding or action arising from or in connection with his
-- src:2257 | carrying on of such business; or
@ref Schedule para 4 (src:2252-2257)
GIVEN `the kind of proceeding or action` IS A `Kind of legal proceeding or action`
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`The Schedule para 4 the proceeding or action arises from the carrying on of a business by a minor registered under the Business Names Registration Act 2014` MEANS
    CONSIDER `the kind of proceeding or action`
    WHEN `Proceeding arising from the carrying on of a business by a minor registered under the Business Names Registration Act 2014` THEN JUST TRUE
    OTHERWISE NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "Where the minor is registered under the Business Names Registration Act 2014 to carry on any business ... any legal proceeding or action arising from or in connection with his carrying on of such business"

-- src:2261 | 5. Where the minor carries on business in Singapore as a limited partnership
-- src:2262 | registered under the Limited Partnerships Act 2008 (whether as a general partner
-- src:2263 | or a limited partner) —
-- src:2265 | (a) any legal proceeding or action arising from or in connection with his
-- src:2266 | carrying on of such business; or
-- src:2268 | (b) any legal proceeding or action arising from or in connection with his
-- src:2269 | acting as a person responsible for the management of such business (as
-- src:2270 | defined in section 39(2) of that Act).
@ref Schedule para 5 (src:2261-2270)
GIVEN `the kind of proceeding or action` IS A `Kind of legal proceeding or action`
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`The Schedule para 5 the proceeding or action arises from the minor's business as a limited partnership registered under the Limited Partnerships Act 2008` MEANS
    CONSIDER `the kind of proceeding or action`
    WHEN `Proceeding arising from the carrying on of business by a minor as a partner in a limited partnership registered under the Limited Partnerships Act 2008` THEN JUST TRUE
    WHEN `Proceeding arising from the minor acting as a person responsible for the management of a limited partnership business` THEN JUST TRUE
    OTHERWISE NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "Where the minor carries on business in Singapore as a limited partnership registered under the Limited Partnerships Act 2008 ... (a) any legal proceeding or action arising from or in connection with his carrying on of such business; or (b) ... acting as a person responsible for the management of such business"

-- The Schedule as a whole: is the proceeding or action one of those it specifies?  A bare list (section 36(1)(a) says "specified in the Schedule"
-- and does not say the Schedule "has effect for determining" it): when no paragraph holds the answer is NOTHING (fork QC).
@ref Schedule paragraphs 1 to 5 (src:2229-2270)
GIVEN `the kind of proceeding or action` IS A `Kind of legal proceeding or action`
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`The Schedule the proceeding or action is one to which section 36 applies` MEANS
    CONSIDER `the kind of proceeding or action`
    WHEN `Another proceeding` THEN NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "LEGAL PROCEEDINGS AND ACTIONS TO WHICH SECTION 36 APPLIES" -- a bare list; section 36(1)(a) says "specified in the Schedule" and not that the Schedule has effect for determining it (fork QC); section 36(2) lets the Minister amend it
    OTHERWISE JUST TRUE

§§ `Sections 35 and 36 and the Schedule -- tests`

-- the age of 18: both sides of the birthday (born 15 March 2007: 18 on 15 March 2025)
#ASSERT `the minor has attained the age of 18 years on` (Date 15 3 2007) (Date 14 3 2025) EQUALS FALSE -- the day before the 18th birthday
#ASSERT `the minor has attained the age of 18 years on` (Date 15 3 2007) (Date 15 3 2025) EQUALS TRUE -- the 18th birthday itself (fork F-A2)
#ASSERT `the minor has attained the age of 18 years on` (Date 29 2 2008) (Date 27 2 2026) EQUALS FALSE -- born on a leap day: two days before the roll
#ASSERT `the minor has attained the age of 18 years on` (Date 29 2 2008) (Date 28 2 2026) EQUALS TRUE -- born on a leap day: attains 18 on 28 February in a year that is not leap (fork F-A1)
-- s 35(1): date of birth, contract date, otherwise-provided
#ASSERT `s 35(1) the contract has effect as if the minor were of full age` (Date 15 3 2007) (Date 15 3 2025) FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE -- the 18th birthday: "shall have effect as if he were of full age"
#ASSERT `s 35(1) the contract has effect as if the minor were of full age` (Date 15 3 2007) (Date 14 3 2025) FALSE EQUALS NOTHING -- 17: "who has attained the age of 18 years"
#ASSERT `s 35(1) the contract has effect as if the minor were of full age` (Date 15 3 2007) (Date 15 3 2025) TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE -- "Except as otherwise provided"
#ASSERT `s 35(1) the contract has effect as if the minor were of full age` (Date 15 3 1990) (Date 28 2 2009) FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE -- the day before 1 March 2009: "as from 1 March 2009"
#ASSERT `s 35(1) the contract has effect as if the minor were of full age` (Date 15 3 1990) (Date 1 3 2009) FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE -- 1 March 2009
-- s 35(2)
#ASSERT `s 35(2) subsection (1) applies to the minor and to the contract` (Date 15 3 1991) (Date 1 3 2009) EQUALS JUST FALSE -- born 15 March 1991, so 17 on 1 March 2009: "Where" (subsection (1) itself reaches him from his 18th birthday)
#ASSERT `s 35(2) subsection (1) applies to the minor and to the contract` (Date 1 3 1991) (Date 1 3 2009) EQUALS JUST TRUE -- already 18 on 1 March 2009, contract on that day
#ASSERT `s 35(2) subsection (1) applies to the minor and to the contract` (Date 1 3 1991) (Date 28 2 2009) EQUALS JUST FALSE -- contract the day before: "on and after that day"
#ASSERT `s 35(2) subsection (1) applies to the minor and to the contract` (Date 15 3 1991) (Date 20 3 2009) EQUALS JUST FALSE -- not 18 on 1 March 2009: "Where"
-- s 35(3)
#ASSERT `s 35(3)(a) subsection (1) affects or alters the minor's lack of capacity` TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE -- "shall not affect or alter"
#ASSERT `s 35(3)(a) subsection (1) affects or alters the minor's lack of capacity` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING -- a lack of capacity because of age
#ASSERT `s 35(3)(b) subsection (1) affects the application of the provision of the other written law` TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE -- "shall not affect or alter"
#ASSERT `s 35(3)(b) subsection (1) affects the application of the provision of the other written law` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING -- another provision
-- s 35(4): each head, with the 3-year lease carved out
#ASSERT `s 35(4) the contract has effect as if the minor were of full age by virtue of subsection (1)` TRUE `Contract for the sale purchase mortgage assignment or settlement of land` EQUALS JUST FALSE -- (a)
#ASSERT `s 35(4) the contract has effect as if the minor were of full age by virtue of subsection (1)` TRUE `Contract for a lease of land not exceeding 3 years` EQUALS NOTHING -- (a), "other than a contract for a lease of land not exceeding 3 years" (QE)
#ASSERT `s 35(4) the contract has effect as if the minor were of full age by virtue of subsection (1)` TRUE `Contract for a lease of land for more than 3 years` EQUALS JUST FALSE -- (b)
#ASSERT `s 35(4) the contract has effect as if the minor were of full age by virtue of subsection (1)` TRUE `Contract by which the minor's beneficial interest under a trust is sold transferred or pledged` EQUALS JUST FALSE -- (c)
#ASSERT `s 35(4) the contract has effect as if the minor were of full age by virtue of subsection (1)` TRUE `Contract for the settlement of legal proceedings in which the minor is under disability on account of age` EQUALS JUST FALSE -- (d)(i)
#ASSERT `s 35(4) the contract has effect as if the minor were of full age by virtue of subsection (1)` TRUE `Contract for the settlement of a claim from which such proceedings may arise` EQUALS JUST FALSE -- (d)(ii)
#ASSERT `s 35(4) the contract has effect as if the minor were of full age by virtue of subsection (1)` TRUE `Contract extinguishing a trust or varying its terms` EQUALS NOTHING -- not in subsection (4): see (5)(b)
#ASSERT `s 35(4) the contract has effect as if the minor were of full age by virtue of subsection (1)` TRUE `Another kind of contract` EQUALS NOTHING -- not named
#ASSERT `s 35(4) the contract has effect as if the minor were of full age by virtue of subsection (1)` FALSE `Contract for a lease of land for more than 3 years` EQUALS NOTHING -- not a minor who has attained 18
-- s 35(5)
#ASSERT `s 35(5)(a) subsection (1) entitles the trustee to pay money or deliver property to the minor` TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE -- "does not entitle"
#ASSERT `s 35(5)(a) subsection (1) entitles the trustee to pay money or deliver property to the minor` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING -- in accordance with the terms of the trust
#ASSERT `s 35(5)(b) subsection (1) entitles the minor to enter into the contract and the contract has effect as if the minor were of full age` `Contract extinguishing a trust or varying its terms` EQUALS JUST FALSE -- "does not entitle ... a minor ... to enter into a contract whereby a trust is extinguished"
#ASSERT `s 35(5)(b) subsection (1) entitles the minor to enter into the contract and the contract has effect as if the minor were of full age` `Another kind of contract` EQUALS NOTHING -- not that kind
-- gathered
#ASSERT `s 35 the contract has effect as if the minor were of full age` (Date 15 3 2007) (Date 15 3 2025) FALSE `Another kind of contract` EQUALS JUST TRUE -- an ordinary contract by a minor of 18
#ASSERT `s 35 the contract has effect as if the minor were of full age` (Date 15 3 2007) (Date 15 3 2025) FALSE `Contract for a lease of land for more than 3 years` EQUALS JUST FALSE -- (4)(b)
#ASSERT `s 35 the contract has effect as if the minor were of full age` (Date 15 3 2007) (Date 15 3 2025) FALSE `Contract extinguishing a trust or varying its terms` EQUALS JUST FALSE -- (5)(b)
#ASSERT `s 35 the contract has effect as if the minor were of full age` (Date 15 3 2007) (Date 15 3 2025) FALSE `Contract for a lease of land not exceeding 3 years` EQUALS JUST TRUE -- the lease not exceeding 3 years is outside (4)(a)'s list, so (1) applies
#ASSERT `s 35 the contract has effect as if the minor were of full age` (Date 15 3 2007) (Date 14 3 2025) FALSE `Another kind of contract` EQUALS NOTHING -- under 18
-- s 35(6), (7)
#ASSERT `s 35(6) section 35 applies to or affects the contract` (Date 28 2 2009) EQUALS JUST FALSE -- "any contract that was made before 1 March 2009"
#ASSERT `s 35(6) section 35 applies to or affects the contract` (Date 1 3 2009) EQUALS NOTHING -- 1 March 2009: not before
#ASSERT `s 35(6) the law in force immediately before 1 March 2009 continues to apply to the contract` (Date 28 2 2009) EQUALS JUST TRUE -- "shall continue to apply"
#ASSERT `s 35(6) the law in force immediately before 1 March 2009 continues to apply to the contract` (Date 1 3 2009) EQUALS NOTHING -- 1 March 2009: not before
#ASSERT `s 35(7) section 35 limits or affects the rule of law` TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE -- "Nothing in this section shall limit or affect"
#ASSERT `s 35(7) section 35 limits or affects the rule of law` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING -- another rule
-- s 36
#ASSERT `s 36(1)(a) the minor may in his own name and without a litigation representative bring defend conduct or intervene in the proceeding or action as if he were of full age` TRUE TRUE (JUST TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE -- a Schedule proceeding
#ASSERT `s 36(1)(a) the minor may in his own name and without a litigation representative bring defend conduct or intervene in the proceeding or action as if he were of full age` TRUE TRUE (JUST FALSE) EQUALS NOTHING -- not in the Schedule: no "only"
#ASSERT `s 36(1)(a) the minor may in his own name and without a litigation representative bring defend conduct or intervene in the proceeding or action as if he were of full age` TRUE TRUE NOTHING EQUALS NOTHING -- whether it is in the Schedule is not known
#ASSERT `s 36(1)(a) the minor may in his own name and without a litigation representative bring defend conduct or intervene in the proceeding or action as if he were of full age` TRUE FALSE (JUST TRUE) EQUALS NOTHING -- under another legal disability
#ASSERT `s 36(1)(a) the minor may in his own name and without a litigation representative bring defend conduct or intervene in the proceeding or action as if he were of full age` FALSE TRUE (JUST TRUE) EQUALS NOTHING -- not yet 18
#ASSERT `s 36(1)(b) the minor is considered to be a person under disability on account of his age` TRUE TRUE (JUST TRUE) EQUALS JUST FALSE -- "shall not be considered to be a person under disability on account of his age"
#ASSERT `s 36(1)(b) the minor is considered to be a person under disability on account of his age` TRUE TRUE (JUST FALSE) EQUALS NOTHING -- not a Schedule proceeding
#ASSERT `s 36(1)(b) the minor is considered to be a person under disability on account of his age` TRUE FALSE (JUST TRUE) EQUALS NOTHING -- under another legal disability
#ASSERT `s 36(2) the Minister has amended the Schedule` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE -- "by order published in the Gazette"
#ASSERT `s 36(2) the Minister has amended the Schedule` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING -- no order among the sources
-- the Schedule
#ASSERT `The Schedule para 1 the proceeding or action arises from a contract to which the minor is a party and which has effect under section 35` (JUST TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE -- paragraph 1
#ASSERT `The Schedule para 1 the proceeding or action arises from a contract to which the minor is a party and which has effect under section 35` (JUST FALSE) EQUALS NOTHING -- the contract does not have that effect
#ASSERT `The Schedule para 1 the proceeding or action arises from a contract to which the minor is a party and which has effect under section 35` NOTHING EQUALS NOTHING -- whether it does is not known
#ASSERT `The Schedule para 2 the proceeding or action arises from the minor acting as a director of a company or a manager of a limited liability partnership` `Proceeding arising from the minor acting as a director of a company` EQUALS JUST TRUE -- 2(a)
#ASSERT `The Schedule para 2 the proceeding or action arises from the minor acting as a director of a company or a manager of a limited liability partnership` `Proceeding arising from the minor acting as a manager of a limited liability partnership` EQUALS JUST TRUE -- 2(b)
#ASSERT `The Schedule para 2 the proceeding or action arises from the minor acting as a director of a company or a manager of a limited liability partnership` `Another proceeding` EQUALS NOTHING -- not paragraph 2
#ASSERT `The Schedule para 3 the proceeding or action arises from a bill of exchange drawn or indorsed by the minor or by another person in favour of the minor` `Proceeding arising from a bill of exchange drawn or indorsed by the minor` EQUALS JUST TRUE -- 3(a)
#ASSERT `The Schedule para 3 the proceeding or action arises from a bill of exchange drawn or indorsed by the minor or by another person in favour of the minor` `Proceeding arising from a bill of exchange drawn or indorsed by another person in favour of the minor` EQUALS JUST TRUE -- 3(b)
#ASSERT `The Schedule para 3 the proceeding or action arises from a bill of exchange drawn or indorsed by the minor or by another person in favour of the minor` `Another proceeding` EQUALS NOTHING -- not paragraph 3
#ASSERT `The Schedule para 4 the proceeding or action arises from the carrying on of a business by a minor registered under the Business Names Registration Act 2014` `Proceeding arising from the carrying on of a business by a minor registered under the Business Names Registration Act 2014` EQUALS JUST TRUE -- 4(a)
#ASSERT `The Schedule para 4 the proceeding or action arises from the carrying on of a business by a minor registered under the Business Names Registration Act 2014` `Another proceeding` EQUALS NOTHING -- not paragraph 4
#ASSERT `The Schedule para 5 the proceeding or action arises from the minor's business as a limited partnership registered under the Limited Partnerships Act 2008` `Proceeding arising from the carrying on of business by a minor as a partner in a limited partnership registered under the Limited Partnerships Act 2008` EQUALS JUST TRUE -- 5(a)
#ASSERT `The Schedule para 5 the proceeding or action arises from the minor's business as a limited partnership registered under the Limited Partnerships Act 2008` `Proceeding arising from the minor acting as a person responsible for the management of a limited partnership business` EQUALS JUST TRUE -- 5(b)
#ASSERT `The Schedule para 5 the proceeding or action arises from the minor's business as a limited partnership registered under the Limited Partnerships Act 2008` `Another proceeding` EQUALS NOTHING -- not paragraph 5
#ASSERT `The Schedule the proceeding or action is one to which section 36 applies` `Proceeding arising from a bill of exchange drawn or indorsed by the minor` EQUALS JUST TRUE -- a paragraph holds
#ASSERT `The Schedule the proceeding or action is one to which section 36 applies` `Proceeding arising from the minor acting as a director of a company` EQUALS JUST TRUE -- a paragraph holds
#ASSERT `The Schedule the proceeding or action is one to which section 36 applies` `Another proceeding` EQUALS NOTHING -- no paragraph holds: a bare list (QC)
